SUMMARY:Music Bingo @ Hi-Wire RAD Beer Garden
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nJoin us for music bingo at the Hi-Wire R
 AD Beer Garden!\n**Bingo starts at 6** but I'll be getting there early to 
 grab food and a drink beforehand.\n\nMake sure to bring a **charged cell p
 hone** as everyone completes their bingo sheet digitally.\n\nHope to see y
 ou there!
