SUMMARY:The League of the Scarlet Pimpernel by Montford Players
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nThe League of the Scarlet Pimpernel is a
  fresh spin on the classic tales penned by Baroness Orzy a century ago.\n\
 nDuring the French Revolution\, a mysterious and egalitarian group risks e
 verything to rescue the unjustly accused from the guillotine\, working tir
 elessly to save the innocent from the machinations of a power-mad\, tyrann
 ical government. In their daring rescues\, the League always leaves behind
  a tiny red flower as their signature.\n\nThe League’s arch-enemy\, Arma
 nd Chauvelin\, devises a nefarious plan that could put an end to the heroi
 c league. With danger closing in\, all members of the League will use thei
 r extraordinary talents to save a family from near-certain death. This swa
 shbuckling tale of love\, loyalty and bravery promises laughter\, intrigue
  and plenty of adventure.\n\nThe show begins at 7:30pm.\nStepped ground se
 ating is free\, remember to bring blankets\, pillows\, campchairs\, etc to
  be more comfortable. If you’d like to make an online donation before th
 e show you can do so here: [https://www.montfordparkplayers.org/](https://
 www.montfordparkplayers.org/get-tickets-2/)\n\nThe actors will come around
  at intermission for cash or venmo donations and they typically have a foo
 d and drink vendor of some kind.\n\nAsheville’s Montford Park Players is
  North Carolina’s longest running Shakespeare theatre company dedicated 
 to providing exceptional dramatic entertainment for the enrichment\, educa
 tion\, and enjoyment of their audiences\, free of charge.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314228730
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T121149Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T121149Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
